# oracle: oxDNA3 unique_bp (hybrid/overlay oxdna3/excv oxdna3/stk oxdna3/hbond oxdna3/xstk oxdna3/coaxstk oxdna3/dh, oxdna3/fene bonds) of the LAMMPS cgdna lj oxDNA3 example, T 0.1, rhos 0.2, 100 steps at timestep 5e-3; the example's balance, print and dump commands are left out (one process, no effect on the forces), and so is its fix langevin ... angmom 10 thermostat (the engine refuses angmom on finite-size particles), so the run is NVE
# oracle-inputs: w78oxdna3_lj_unique_bp.data
# oracle-potentials: oxdna3_lj.cgdna
# oracle-compare: thermo=all atoms=all rel=1e-8 abs=1e-12
# Measured with native LAMMPS (black box): every thermo and per-atom value agrees to a relative error below 1e-14, except real unique_bp at step 100 (ebond) where it is 4e-14
units           lj
dimension       3
newton          on
boundary        p p p
atom_style      hybrid bond ellipsoid oxdna
atom_modify     sort 0 1.0
neighbor        2.0 bin
neigh_modify    every 1 delay 0 check yes
fix             Basepairs all property/atom i_idc ghost yes
read_data       w78oxdna3_lj_unique_bp.data fix Basepairs NULL Basepairs
set             atom * mass 3.1575
bond_style      hybrid oxdna3/fene
bond_coeff      * oxdna3/fene oxdna3_lj.cgdna
special_bonds   lj 0 1 1
pair_style      hybrid/overlay oxdna3/excv oxdna3/stk oxdna3/hbond oxdna3/xstk oxdna3/coaxstk oxdna3/dh
pair_coeff      * * oxdna3/excv oxdna3_lj.cgdna
pair_coeff      * * oxdna3/stk 0.1 oxdna3_lj.cgdna
pair_coeff      * * oxdna3/hbond oxdna3_lj.cgdna
pair_coeff      1 4 oxdna3/hbond oxdna3_lj.cgdna
pair_coeff      2 3 oxdna3/hbond oxdna3_lj.cgdna
pair_coeff      * * oxdna3/xstk oxdna3_lj.cgdna
pair_coeff      * * oxdna3/coaxstk oxdna3_lj.cgdna
pair_coeff      * * oxdna3/dh 0.1 0.2 oxdna3_lj.cgdna
fix             1 all nve/asphere
timestep        5e-3
comm_modify     cutoff 32.4
thermo_style    custom step temp pe ebond evdwl ke etotal
thermo_modify   format float %.15g
thermo          10
run             100
